  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in the bottom of a clay or ceramic tagine or a large Dutch oven over medium heat",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent and starting to caramelize",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute",
    "Stir in the curry powder and cook for 1 minute",
    "Add the tomato paste and cook for 1 minute",
    "Add the vegetable broth and bring the mixture to a boil",
    "Add the vermicelli pasta and cook until it is al dente",
    "Stir in the coconut milk and cook until the sauce has thickened",
    "Season the tagine with salt and black pepper to taste",
    "Serve the tagine hot over the cooked pasta"
  ],
